WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.699
Welcome to Module 3.

00:00:01.699 --> 00:00:03.994
Today we go clean our data.

00:00:03.994 --> 00:00:08.242
Dirty data dey give wrong answer — make we fix am.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:15.868
If you write di same sale two times, your total go big pass wetin you really make.

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:19.500
For Excel, go Data, then Remove Duplicates.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:28.224
Agege bread, agege b-r-d, all capital AGEGE — computer go think say na three different products.

00:00:28.224 --> 00:00:31.400
Choose one name and use am every time.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.464
Write your dates di same way every time.

00:00:35.464 --> 00:00:39.500
For amount, put only number, no write fifteen k.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.284
And if box empty, try find di correct number.

00:00:43.984 --> 00:00:51.557
When your data clean, di answer wey you get go correct, and di decision wey you take go correct too.

00:00:52.257 --> 00:00:55.159
Go check your sheet now and clean am.

00:00:55.159 --> 00:00:56.806
See you for Module 4!
